  m_text: 'An exciting journey through the world of knowledge awaits you! At each
    level, you will be asked a question with several possible answers. However, be
    careful: the time for thinking is reduced with each new level!

    If you manage
    to choose the correct answer before the timer ends, you will move on to the next
    level and can earn additional points. But if you answer incorrectly or do not
    have time, the game will end.'
